{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13104070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13104070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310407001:0":{"text":"また会ったな、諸君。もうすぐ舞踏会が始まるぞ。","source_cn":"诸位，夜安。你们来得正好，舞会快要开始了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26BA631716E57478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310407002:0":{"text":"こんばんは！あら？舞踏会の服ではないのですね。フェルガルドさんのタキシード姿が見られると思ったのに……","source_cn":"晚上好。咦，你没有换舞会的服装呢，我还以为可以见到穿着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F80C3EACFEB3C7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310407003:0":{"text":"会場の見張りや、生きた屍と戦う時、正装だと動きづらくてな、期待に応えられず申し訳ない。","source_cn":"啊，抱歉，没法满足你的要求了。我还得负责巡视场地，驱逐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B7C5C7EBD466C04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310407004:0":{"text":"フェルガルドさんは本当に物腰穏やかで礼儀正しいオオカミさんですね！","source_cn":"呀，法拉莫尔先生是我见过最温柔最有礼貌的狼先生了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB42D27ACDC7DC42C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310407005:0":{"text":"お褒めに預かり光栄だ。それはそうと、舞踏会は参加者も多い。「何かが」潜り込んでいる可能性もないとは言い切れない……","source_cn":"话说回来，请诸位务必注意安全。参加舞会的人很多，你知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x529A3678AD944824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310407006:0":{"text":"ご安心ください！ちゃんと用心します！","source_cn":"放心吧！我们能保护好自己，也会提高警戒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4211754864DFB44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"フェルガルド","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}